  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation ARISE (Equal Chances for Human Developement)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: ARISE (Equal Chances for Human Developement) - The Overall Objective of the Action is to support the children of Zambia to reach their potential and to improve young female adolescent&#xbf;s resilience in alignment with Zambia&#xbf;s human development commitments under 8th National Development Plan. To achieve this global objective, the Action will follow three more specific objectives:_ Improve nurturing care through more inclusive and equitable access to quality early childhood development and education (ECDE) for young children (0-8);_ Decrease inequalities through enhancing wellbeing and opportunities for adolescent girls_ Strengthened coordination across government systems to enhance the effectiveness of integrated service delivery to young children (0-8) and to female adolescents;</narrative>
  </description>
